### GrainZero Backend API Tests
### Variables (Update tokens after running login)
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3001/api
@adminToken = your_admin_jwt_here
@studentToken = your_student_jwt_here

### 1. SETTINGS
### 1.1 GET settings (any logged in user)
GET {{baseUrl}}/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 1.2 PUT settings (admin only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "wallet_percent": 30,
  "buffer_percent": 10,
  "mess_fee_paise": 600000
}

### 1.3 PUT meal slot (admin only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/meal-slots/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start_time": "07:30",
  "end_time": "09:00",
  "cutoff_time": "06:30",
  "cost_paise": 3000
}

### 2. MENU
### 2.1 GET menu for date
GET {{baseUrl}}/menu?date=2026-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 2.2 POST admin meal (creates or replaces dishes)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/meals
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-11-02",
  "meal_type": "lunch",
  "dishes": ["Rice", "Roti", "Paneer Butter Masala", "Dal Tadka"]
}

### 2.3 POST add dish to meal
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/meals/1/dishes
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Gulab Jamun"
}

### 2.4 POST copy menu
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/menu/copy
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from_date": "2026-10-31",
  "to_date": "2026-11-03"
}

### 3. STUDENT SKIPS
### 3.1 GET student today & tomorrow
GET {{baseUrl}}/student/today
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 3.2 POST student skip
POST {{baseUrl}}/student/skips
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "meal_id": 1
}

### 3.3 DELETE student skip (undo)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/student/skips/1
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 4. WALLET & INVOICES
### 4.1 GET student wallet
GET {{baseUrl}}/student/wallet
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 4.2 GET student invoices
GET {{baseUrl}}/student/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 5. ADMIN HEADCOUNT & SKIP LOG
### 5.1 GET headcount
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/headcount?date=2026-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 5.2 GET skip-log JSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/skip-log?date=2026-10-31&meal_type=lunch
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 5.3 GET skip-log CSV
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/skip-log.csv?date=2026-10-31&meal_type=lunch
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 6. WASTE
### 6.1 POST waste log
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/waste
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "meal_id": 1,
  "cooked_kg": 42.5,
  "leftover_kg": 6.2
}

### 6.2 GET waste summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/waste-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 7. FEES
### 7.1 POST generate fees
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/fees/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session_name": "November 2026"
}

### 7.2 GET fees list
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/fees
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

